OL,3,GNEWSACouncil worker 'asked to attend
OL,4,Ameeting at Anne Donaghy's home' to
OL,5,Adiscuss deleted emails
OL,6,
OL,7,FA member of staff who worked on Freedom
OL,8,Fof Information (FoI) requests at Mid
OL,9,Fand East Antrim Council was asked to
OL,10,Fattend a meeting in 2021 at the then
OL,11,Fcouncil chief executive's house on a
OL,12,FSunday to discuss deleted emails, a
OL,13,Fcourt has heard.
OL,15,FThe chief executive at the time,
OL,16,F56-year-old Anne Donaghy, of Clonmore
OL,17,FRoad in Dungannon, denies three charges
OL,18,Frelated to deleting or attempting to
OL,19,Fdelete an email in contravention of the
OL,20,FFreedom of Information Act and aiding
OL,21,Fand abetting another person to do so.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
