OL,3,GNEWSACouncil worker 'asked to attend
OL,4,Ameeting at Anne Donaghy's home' to
OL,5,Adiscuss deleted emails
OL,6,
OL,7,FHer co-accused, Aaron McClelland, 49,
OL,8,Fof Clonmakate Road in Portadown, denies
OL,9,Fone charge of attempting to delete an
OL,10,Femail. He was described in court as
OL,11,Fhaving oversight of the council's FoI
OL,12,Fsystem.
OL,14,FPaul Thompson gave evidence on the
OL,15,Fsecond day of Donaghy's trial.
